[edu] edu: DMA both ways via IOMMU ok
iommu: fault 0:3.0: write not permitted at 0x8000000
proc: edu (pid 1) killed by kernel request
devmgr: edu on 0:3.0 exited with -1000 (run 1)
[edu] edu: DMA both ways via IOMMU ok
iommu: fault 0:3.0
devmgr: edu on 0:3.0 exited with -1000 (run 6)
devmgr: edu on 0:3.0 failed 6 times, giving up
